    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Allen & Jacobs is delighted to present No. 40 Block A, The Bottleworks an exceptionally bright, stylish, and beautifully maintained top-floor two-bedroom apartment in this highly sought-after development. Offered in pristine condition throughout, No. 40 offers a well-designed, light-filled accommodation, complete with a secure underground parking space and access to a communal roof garden.\n\nThe property features a spacious open-plan living/dining room with a contemporary kitchen, two generous double bedrooms, and two bathrooms (master en-suite). A standout feature of this top-floor home is its dual outdoor space: a main south-west facing balcony off the living area perfect for enjoying evening sun, plus a private second balcony off the primary bedroom. The apartment also includes a useful utility/storage area off the kitchen.\n\nThe Bottleworks is a well-managed development arranged around a landscaped central courtyard, with pedestrian access to both Dermot O`Hurley Avenue and Ringsend Village.\n\n\nTop-floor two-bedroom apartment\nDual balconies, including a main south-west facing sit-out balcony off the living area and a second private balcony off the primary bedroom\n\nSecure underground parking space, lift access, and communal roof garden access\neautifully maintained throughout with utility/storage area off the kitchen\n\nBuilding \n\nEnergy Rating: BER D1\n\nViewing\nStrictly by prior appointment.\n\n\nTel: (01) 531 3939\n\n\nEmail: lettings@allenandjacobs.ie\n"
